</style>
<small>shape: (7, 3)</small><table border="1" class="dataframe"><thead><tr><th>Day</th><th>Sales</th><th>Cum_Sales</th></tr><tr><td>str</td><td>i64</td><td>i64</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&quot;Mon&quot;</td><td>182</td><td>182</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Tue&quot;</td><td>247</td><td>429</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Wed&quot;</td><td>547</td><td>976</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Thur&quot;</td><td>481</td><td>1457</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Fri&quot;</td><td>319</td><td>1776</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Sat&quot;</td><td>208</td><td>1984</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Sun&quot;</td><td>67</td><td>2051</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
```
:::
:::


<br>
So, if you had a target of $2,000 by the end of the week, you'd know by Friday that you're not too far from hitting that target.

